          "beatId": "beat_d50dfa437724e5689b90de155ad61e97",
          "segmentOrdinal": 6,
          "text": "指南按照清空、分类、分区和维护，安排整理的步骤。",
          "textHash": "sha256:805d7c94a94becfe1a2fa5705ba8bdac60da424e71441b4e9fa0e743c0852ac1",
          "factIds": [
            "guide.01.07"
